ile": null}, {"sha": "e2139f0b550c43585ce197d457b61c2ecad25070", "message": "Update release github file to correctly compute the artifact version", "created_at": "2022-08-31T18:20:39Z", "repo": "suil", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "facb770b1fe01aaf59c46fb9d983267c1c4dd7bf", "message": "Update release github file to correctly compute the artifact version", "created_at": "2022-08-31T18:02:28Z", "repo": "suil", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2894924dc3759fe9a35b3bf833be59b2a3c9c106", "message": "Update release github file to correctly compute the artifact version", "created_at": "2022-08-31T17:39:27Z", "repo": "suil", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "de6f608d38f6546aee2a8a4cc96a3d61f23eb5d6", "message": "Reverting multi-threaded and replacing with multi-processes (#19)\n\n* Adding a visual studio code development environment\r\n\r\n* Adding support for refresh JWT in our http session middleware (#6)\r\n\r\n* Added support for refresh JWT in our http session middleware\r\n* Improved VS Code Remote Development environment\r\n\r\n* Rework CMake source to use more modern patterns (#7)\r\n\r\n* Reworked CMake in an attempt to improve or make it more modern. I am no CMake guru, but learning as I go\r\n\r\n* Added a script `Suil.cmake` can be used by suil apps to configure themselves for linking against suil (#8)\r\n\r\n* Updated readme file\r\n\r\n* Allow suil to build some of the components it needs (#10)\r\n\r\n* Allow suil to build some of the components it needs\r\n\r\n* Modified Suil.cmake to add more features that simplify application development (#11)\r\n\r\n* Update README.md\r\n\r\n* Topic/dc/app cmake (#12)\r\n\r\n* Modified Suil.cmake to add more features that simplify application development\r\n\r\n* Change ZMQ socket monitor to use libmill's Mutex and Sync objects\r\n\r\n* Updated websocket\r\n\r\n* Support for secp256k1\r\nSupport for command line arguments\r\nAdd system On, which allows subscribing to signals\r\nMinor fixes\r\n\r\n* Add support for returning exceptions\r\n\r\n* Fix json unit test\r\n\r\n* Add support for sawtooth client library (#13)\r\n\r\n* Update Suil application cmake file to find needed libraries\r\n\r\n* * Re-write SCC code generator libraries (#15)\r\n\r\nAdd code to generate scc enums\r\n\r\n* * Update github actions script\r\n\r\n* * Update github actions script\r\n\r\n* * Update github actions script\r\n\r\n* * Update github actions script\r\n\r\n* * Update github actions script\r\n\r\n* * Update github actions script\r\n\r\n* * Update github actions script\r\n\r\n* * Update github actions script\r\n\r\n* * Update github actions script\r\n\r\n* Fix bug with http Content-Type\r\n\r\n* * Fix database bugs (use `Deadline` on cached connection expiry)\r\n\r\n* * Fix request query string\r\n* Also modified `Return` API which is used in  `TryCatch`\r\n\r\n* * Fix dependency bug\r\n\r\n* * Fix a few bugs on postgres db middleware\r\n\r\n* * Allow a default value to be specified when using `Return`\r\n\r\n* * Pin scc to version 0.1.0, latest version of scc is currently not compatible with suil\r\n\r\n* Update postgres SQL database statement to parse to a tuple (#17)\r\n\r\n* Update postgres SQL database statement to parse to a tuple\r\n\r\n* Copy benchmark code for debugging purposes\r\n\r\n* Fix current build (#18)\r\n\r\n* Replace multi-thread with single process to allow for easier coroutines (as in go)\r\n\r\n* Update multi-process API\r\n\r\n* Update release github file to correctly compute the artifact version", "created_at": "2022-08-31T17:14:13Z", "repo": "suil", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ac0ba9bc7be8d991e03b55e9dda70f1cf406955", "message": "Fix current build (#18)", "created_at": "2022-08-26T22:30:01Z", "repo": "suil", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b9e